Package: uiuc.mcmc
Type: Package
Title: Markov Chain Monte Carlo Sampler and Convergence Diagnostics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("William", "Rosenbloom", email = "wrosenb2@illinois.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jenny", "Li", email = "jennyli3@illinois.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements a general Metropolis-Hastings Markov Chain Monte Carlo
    (MCMC) sampler from scratch comparing Symmetric Random Walk, Independent,
    and Metropolis-Adjusted Langevin Algorithm (MALA) proposal distributions,
    along with S3 methods and standalone convergence diagnostics.
